es with Tuffy along the way. Easy to learn, fun to master. This game delivers a casual 3D experience that keeps you coming back. Join Tuffy and start your next relaxing adventure!", "artistId": 1805136982, "artistName": "Zenergy Games", "userRatingCount": 0}]}